WEBVTT

00:56:28.167 --> 00:56:31.601
This is another paradox point though,
that you yourself have made, right?

00:56:31.625 --> 00:56:34.393
Which is you can love
a person and still say,

00:56:34.417 --> 00:56:36.434
"This relationship is not right for me."

00:56:36.458 --> 00:56:40.059
And why not believe
the same is true about a job?

00:56:40.083 --> 00:56:42.809
EP: The way I've said it
is in marriage today,

00:56:42.833 --> 00:56:47.268
people will say, "It's not that I divorce
because I'm miserable and unhappy,

00:56:47.292 --> 00:56:49.726
it's I divorce
because I could be happier."

00:56:49.750 --> 00:56:52.476
And I think something similar
is happening at work.

00:56:52.500 --> 00:56:54.393
This elusive quest for more,

00:56:54.417 --> 00:56:59.393
for better, for FOMO
and all of that makes us think,

00:56:59.417 --> 00:57:02.518
what else is out there
that I haven't yet done